<p>Thanks for the comment Abettik,</p>
<p>I did got some feedback on shortening the article and trimming the fat. I cleared what I could, and kept the essential stuff. Thing is, a lot of stuff is essential for this SCP to be contained successfully, being it keter: What to do with B and W in public? What about the captured ones? What to do, when there is a disproportional number of either? What to do with the area during the event? And then: How? etc., etc.</p>
<p>Then again, I wanted the hook to be a bit more implicit than other keters. Bunch of guys fighting, they don't do too much to the world, okay&#8230; a few more remaining.. whoa, suddenly the effect is pretty large and could be larger. And then it appears on other (nearby) places, too? Bryx got a pretty good idea how to sum it up above. I remembered the Canada eating fish when writing this one a few times.</p>
<p>I remember our talk at your 2000 proposal and I perfectly respect the different cups of tea here, though.</p>

